      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹54.35 (up from ₹49.83 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹27.6b (up 9.2% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹3.52b (up 9.1% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 13% (in line with FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year.",
